      "text": "*BREAKING #KC VIETNAM: Terrifying new images and pictures from Vietnam's TOP-#Coffee growing region of the Central Highlands and nearby cities confirm continuing WORSENG LIFE-THREATENING conditions both for #KC FARMERS and their families with RAGING FLASH FLOODS from last few days HISTORIC HIGH rainfall near 50% above normal average, already leaving over 100,000 homeless and death toll rising to min 28 earlier Saturday, a number of cities in and near the Central Highland - home to over 70% of TOTAL NATIONAL OUTPUT reported 1700mm rains in a span of only 24 hours - AN ENTIRELY INSANE rain volume of 1.7 meter - and the current #KC situation in Vietnam is fast becoming both a humanitarian tragedy while at the same time causing additional irreversable damage and trouble to the new 2025-26 #coffee harvest AND A NEW TYPHOON is now set to hit Vietnam's Central Highlands HEAD-ON with ALL REGIONS within the scope of what is set to become #typhoons #Kalmaegi already mocing toward making landfall in the Philippines before moving toward Vietnam with local government AND weather authorities warning of more torrential rains, flash floods, flooding and landslides in the coming days and weeks !! PLEASE STAY SAVE MY FRIENDS - PRAYERS ALL AROUND !!\n*Tks for sharing Typhoon tracking @hurricane_chase, if you can add #KC and #coffee to your updates as well as yours truly here @SpillingTheBean would very much appreciate !!",
